{"parentUuid":"6c1d0477-987c-4a56-9631-238271b386f3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- adopt\n- architecture-decision: Creates an Architecture Decision Record (ADR) documenting a significant technical decision, its context, alternatives considered, and consequences. Every major technical choice should have an ADR.\n- architecture-review\n- art-bible\n- asset-audit\n- asset-spec\n- autoplan\n- balance-check\n- benchmark\n- benchmark-models\n- brainstorm: Guided game concept ideation — from zero idea to a structured game concept document. Uses professional studio ideation techniques, player psychology frameworks, and structured creative exploration.\n- browse\n- bug-report\n- bug-triage\n- canary\n- careful\n- changelog\n- code-review\n- codex\n- connect-chrome\n- consistency-check\n- content-audit\n- context-restore\n- context-save\n- create-architecture\n- create-control-manifest\n- create-epics\n- create-stories\n- cso\n- day-one-patch\n- design-consultation\n- design-html\n- design-review\n- design-shotgun\n- design-system\n- dev-story\n- devex-review\n- document-generate\n- document-release\n- estimate\n- freeze\n- gate-check\n- gstack\n- gstack-upgrade\n- guard\n- health\n- help\n- hotfix\n- investigate\n- land-and-deploy\n- landing-report\n- launch-checklist\n- learn\n- localize\n- make-pdf\n- map-systems\n- milestone-review\n- office-hours\n- onboard\n- open-gstack-browser\n- pair-agent\n- patch-notes\n- perf-profile\n- plan-ceo-review\n- plan-design-review\n- plan-devex-review\n- plan-eng-review\n- plan-tune\n- playtest-report\n- project-stage-detect\n- propagate-design-change\n- prototype\n- qa\n- qa-only\n- qa-plan\n- quick-design\n- regression-suite\n- release-checklist\n- retro\n- retrospective\n- reverse-document\n- review\n- review-all-gdds\n- scope-check\n- scrape\n- security-audit\n- setup-browser-cookies\n- setup-deploy\n- setup-engine: Configure the project's game engine and version. Pins the engine in CLAUDE.md, detects knowledge gaps, and populates engine reference docs via WebSearch when the version is beyond the LLM's training data.\n- setup-gbrain\n- ship\n- skill-improve\n- skill-test\n- skillify\n- smoke-check\n- soak-test\n- sprint-plan\n- sprint-status\n- start: First-time onboarding — asks where you are, then guides you to the right workflow. No assumptions.\n- story-done\n- story-readiness\n- sync-gbrain\n- team-audio\n- team-combat\n- team-level\n- team-live-ops\n- team-narrative\n- team-polish\n- team-qa\n- team-release\n- team-ui\n- tech-debt\n- test-evidence-review\n- test-flakiness\n- test-helpers\n- test-setup\n- unfreeze\n- ux-design\n- ux-review\n- vertical-slice\n- superpowers:brainstorming\n- superpowers:using-git-worktrees\n- superpowers:requesting-code-review\n- superpowers:writing-skills\n- superpowers:writing-plans: Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code\n- superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch\n- superpowers:verification-before-completion\n- superpowers:dispatching-parallel-agents\n- superpowers:executing-plans\n- superpowers:receiving-code-review\n- superpowers:subagent-driven-development: Use when executing implementation plans with independent tasks in the current session\n- superpowers:systematic-debugging\n- superpowers:test-driven-development\n- superpowers:using-superpowers\n- academic-writing-skills:academic-writing-skills\n- research-workspace:literature-triage-matrix\n- research-workspace:paper-memory-builder\n- research-workspace:notebooklm-brief-verifier\n- research-workspace:research-hub\n- research-workspace:research-hub-multi-ai\n- research-workspace:paper-summarize\n- research-workspace:research-context-compressor\n- research-workspace:research-project-orienter\n- research-workspace:zotero-library-curator\n- research-workspace:research-design-helper\n- research-workspace:zotero-skills\n- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated b