{"parentUuid":"18b66d85-003b-4493-a724-889a2db661fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"7fe67c60-a142-4927-91b7-de6822322f88","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if video editing can be included in the resume. In their original resume (张翮简历), they mentioned \"简单的视频编辑\" under hobbies and specialties. I already incorporated the hobbies into the self-evaluation section in the new resume.\n\nNow they're asking if editing/video editing skills can be included. I think they want to know if it's appropriate to list video editing as a skill on a finance-job resume.\n\nMy take: It can be included, but it should be positioned carefully. For a finance/accounting position, video editing isn't directly relevant. However, it can be framed as:\n1. A \"supplementary skill\" or \"other skills\" section - shows versatility\n2. Framed as demonstrating digital literacy and creative capabilities\n3. Kept brief and at the bottom, not given too much prominence\n\nThe user already had \"简单的视频编辑\" in their original resume under hobbies. In the template format, it could be added as a separate skill line or kept within the hobbies/self-evaluation section.\n\nI should give a quick, straightforward answer - yes it can go in, but suggest how to position it appropriately.","signature":"7fe67c60-a142-4927-91b7-de6822322f88"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":435,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":59264,"output_tokens":362,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"cdf708ee-be03-4bdd-b7f8-d6dbecf5e961","timestamp":"2026-05-23T10:59:17.840Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"f2285e4